{
	"$comment": "Golden names for the porcelain method option (MethodPolicy.porcelain: a short verb and a handle path). One annotation gives the TypeScript method, the Rust method, the CLI command and the MCP tool. The generator (sylphx-gen) and the reference derivation must agree on every row. Contract: docs/services/contracts/porcelain.md.",
